"TrackShip is syncing fulfillment-based shipments automatically. All new "
"fulfillments will be tracked in real time."
msgstr "TrackShip, fulfillment tabanlı gönderileri otomatik olarak senkronize ediyor. Tüm yeni fulfillment'lar gerçek zamanlı takip edilecek."

